<title>USA: ThermoGenesis names director of finance.</title>
<headline>ThermoGenesis names director of finance.</headline>
<dateline>RANCHO CORDOVA, Calif. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>ThermoGenesis Corp said Friday that it named Renee Ruecker director of finance, a newly-created position.</p>
<p>Ruecker will be responsible for overseeing day-to-day operations in the accounting and finance department and business modeling, the company said.</p>
<p>Most recently, Ruecker was a manager in the Audit and Business Advisory Department at Price Waterhouse LLP in Sacramento, the company said.</p>
